WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 6 - My Beth

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.040
It's from Sakurakouji!

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:03.200
The White Rose Wife

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:08.600
Yippee!

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:19.520
I'm counting on you, Ms. Tsukikage.

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:23.890
We must produce a star as soon as possible!

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:30.300
We've solicited your assistance in order to secure a golden future for our company!

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:33.620
Genzo. Mr. Aoyagi will be leaving now.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:34.770
Pardon?

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.320
Who did this?

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:03.010
Someone invited me to a ball even though I have no feeling in my legs.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:05.370
How insensitive of them!

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:11.200
Who would do such a thing? Or did they not hear of my ordeal?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:11.930
Why?

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.450
Why must I suffer this treatment?!

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:18.030
Have I done something to deserve this?

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.030
No, that can't be it...

00:03:19.030 --> 00:03:21.870
Hey, isn't that Sakurakouji?

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:25.570
The girl next to him is the one who came to spy on our rehearsals!

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.060
What could he possibly want with her?

00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.470
I know!

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:35.310
I know why they call you the White Rose Wife!

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.910
You're beautiful and pure like a white rose...

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:42.800
But your thorns draw crimson blood from anyone who dares to touch you.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:46.860
Why can no one else see that?

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.550
Father!

00:03:49.550 --> 00:03:51.620
Even you!

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:07.260
Maya... Maya!

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:08.810
Here you go.

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.720
I've been holding it for you the whole time.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:13.190
I'm really sorry!

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:15.770
I just got lost in their performances...

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.810
Maya, let's go get something to eat!

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:21.620
What would you like?

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:26.060
Maya... Maya!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.270
Maya!

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:36.820
Thanks for tonight, Sakurakouji!

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:37.640
Bye!

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:54.540
I wonder if I'll ever be as good as Ayumi.

00:04:55.470 --> 00:05:00.170
The Tsukikage Acting Troupe have announced their new show.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:03.600
To raise publicity, the show has been touted as having free admission.

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:07.850
They will be performing Alcott's <i>Little Women</i>.

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.300
They're putting up the cast list!

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:14.100
The lead roles comprise of four young sisters.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:16.020
Firstly: the role of the eldest sister, Meg, will be played...

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.640
by Mina Sawatari.

00:05:20.390 --> 00:05:23.020
The second sister, Jo, will be played by Rei Aoki.

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:28.920
The third sister, Beth, will be played by Maya Kitajima.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:31.690
Me?!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.700
The fourth sister, Amy, will be played by Yumi Shinkawa.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:38.550
You four will be playing the lead roles: the four sisters.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:43.160
I've been cast as Beth. I wonder if I can do it...

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:45.470
Why has someone from Class C been given a role like that?

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.600
It's not fair that she gets to play such a major role!

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.860
Sayaka really wanted to play Beth.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.810
It's a shame; she would've been perfect.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:00.550
I want everyone acting in the production to reconvene in the theater hall.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.100
What's she got that I don't?

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.420
Why does she get to play Beth?

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.240
It's so unfair!

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:10.790
Little Women

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:15.270
<i>Little Women</i> takes place in the United States, during the Civil War.

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:19.580
The story follows four girls who are brought up in a loving environment,

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:21.340
even though they live in poverty.

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:26.890
I want everyone to have an intimate understanding of their character's personality!

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:28.210
Make sure you read the scripts!

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:29.830
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:35.000
And now, I shall detail the rehearsal schedule.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:41.510
You are excused from your other classes until the day of the show.

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:37.030
Soft-spoken Beth.

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:41.500
Kind and introverted, she loves playing the piano...

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:44.030
How would Beth walk?

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:46.380
How would Beth talk?

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:49.760
I can't play the piano.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:57.520
More than a hundred years ago in America, huh?

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.460
I guess our costumes will all be dresses then.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.430
They'll be hard to walk in.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.760
Walking?

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:06.580
Yes, walking. I mean, every character will walk differently, right?

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:09.790
For example, Meg likes to put on airs, so she'll have a natural walk.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.300
Jo is very active, so she'll probably walk like this.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:15.420
And then, Beth would...

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:18.240
But I'll let you figure that one out for yourself.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:18.890
Maya!

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.450
You can't get a feel for it sitting down!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.890
Hey... do you guys want to walk around while we do our read-through?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.350
Sure, we'll help you! Right?

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:31.140
Uh...

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:34.040
Come on, Sayaka.

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:36.930
Okay.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.000
Right, time to clean up!

00:08:02.860 --> 00:08:05.000
What about the costumes?

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:06.750
I've got an idea!

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:10.760
That's your idea?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.750
Is everyone ready?

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:20.020
I ring the bell and they're raising the curtain.

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:23.900
<i>Little Women</i>, Act One, Scene One.

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:25.730
The show's about to start!

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.050
And action!

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:35.860
If you're here to discuss the production rights to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>,

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:38.060
my sentiments remain unchanged.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:41.000
I know that already.

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.550
I trust your troupe is coming along nicely?

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.570
Well enough.

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:47.080
Still getting support from your sponsors?

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:52.210
I know why you're here, Mr. Masumi.

00:08:57.590 --> 00:09:00.350
So you've heard about Aoyagi Productions...

00:09:01.470 --> 00:09:04.610
"Has Mother still not returned?"

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:08.090
"She left to do some Christmas shopping and will be back soon!"

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:13.360
"I don't think it's fair for some girls to have plenty of pretty dresses and other girls, nothing at all."

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:17.700
"We've got Father and Mother."

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:24.090
"Father... I wonder when he'll return from that distant war..."

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.670
What are you trying to say?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.630
That I'm just a figurehead for this troupe?

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:35.700
Aoyagi has acquired his riches through disreputable channels; but he's still a novice.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:40.010
He considers this whole business as just another way to make money.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:48.190
We can't let that slide after pouring our hearts and souls into this!

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:51.620
I'm begging you to cut all ties with your patron!

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:54.100
How dare you say such a thing?

00:09:54.980 --> 00:10:00.640
I will never align myself with you nor your father's Daito stars! Never!

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.640
Now get out!

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:05.880
I never want to see your face here again!

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:12.380
Ouch!

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:14.870
Here... pull that a bit...

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:19.260
What's the meaning of this?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:23.010
We were rehearsing <i>Little Women</i>.

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.270
Beth got all tangled...

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:28.500
Ow, ow, ouch.... Hayami!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:33.520
So you're playing Beth? And a rather tomboyish Beth at that!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:37.250
Uh... yeah. About the fall performance...

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:40.290
It's best not to talk about that here, Maya.

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:43.010
All right, Mr. Masumi. I think it's time for you to leave.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.660
Is something wrong, sir?

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.360
No, no, it's nothing.

00:10:55.630 --> 00:10:59.410
What makes that girl so cheerful?

00:10:59.410 --> 00:11:02.760
Even after she's had to leave her home and follow her path alone.

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:05.490
Rei!

00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:08.970
You wouldn't barge into the home of a distinguished gentleman like that!

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:12.650
Mina! Meg's the eldest and the most mature!

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.920
That's not how she would look when scolding her younger sisters!

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:19.330
Maya! Don't tell me that's how you think shy, retiring Beth would walk!

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:24.190
What an awful night... it's three in the morning!

00:11:24.190 --> 00:11:26.870
This is <i>your</i> fault; you're the one who said I should help out!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:29.590
I only have a bit part, after all...

00:11:34.360 --> 00:11:39.230
It's time to eat, but no one has come down yet.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.190
Good morning!

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.830
This... this...

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:51.350
What happened here?!

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:08.380
"I've come to know our neighbor, Mr. Laurence."

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:11.450
"Beth's cats were our go-betweens!"

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:15.540
"They have a most beautiful greenhouse and a simply wonderful grand piano, don't they?"

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:18.300
"How marvelous!"

00:12:19.510 --> 00:12:21.530
Kitajima! That gesture you just made!

00:12:21.530 --> 00:12:24.590
Do you understand the purpose of your movement?

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:26.910
Um...

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.210
Listen up!

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:32.230
Beth is obviously excited by the grand piano in the mansion next door!

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:34.720
However, because of her extreme reticence, it's impossible for her...

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:37.560
to conceive calling on them.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:41.350
That's why she cuddles the kittens instead of saying something.

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:44.430
<i>That's</i> what this scene is about!

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:47.300
"What a sublime piano!"

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.800
No! No! No!

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:58.930
She gathers up every last shred of her courage and nervously steps forward to play the piano!

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:03.500
When she finally strikes the key, Beth imagines that the sound reverberates...

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:05.910
through the whole mansion, startling her and making her run away!

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:10.250
I'm getting none of her psychological state from your movements!

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.290
What is it, Sayaka?

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:19.270
Maya's acting was just so ludicrous... that's all.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:23.300
Well, you try it, then.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:24.740
Yes, sir!

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.610
From the top!

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.080
Well done.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.840
Just what I'd expect from a Class A student.

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:15.890
I just don't understand.

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.010
How should I depict her?

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:21.390
How do I wear Beth's mask?

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:26.590
Beth has just received an unimaginable gift!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.920
Her overwhelming surprise immediately transforms into fear!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:33.190
Why can't you show something as basic as that through your movements?

00:14:34.230 --> 00:14:36.770
I want you to rehearse on your own for the time being.

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.480
You're holding everyone else back.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:41.650
Until you're ready, I want you to fill the role, Sayaka.

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.220
Y-Yes, sir.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.460
This is bad.

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:52.340
Maya's trying too hard to act before she's gotten a handle on Beth's character.

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:57.300
She has so much natural talent and yet, at this rate...

00:14:57.300 --> 00:15:02.200
Sayaka had all of Beth's lines memorized from the very beginning.

00:15:04.560 --> 00:15:05.650
Maya.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:09.680
Mr. Tashiro asked me to take the role of Beth away from you.

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:12.690
But instead, I'm giving you a week to prove yourself.

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:18.020
You'll have to undergo remedial training until you get into Beth's head.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:20.530
Will you be able to manage that?

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:21.890
I'll do anything!

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:23.670
Please help me!

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.510
Just please don't make me quit!

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:33.450
Sayaka... just because you've become the understudy, that doesn't mean...

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.930
you'll get the role.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:40.690
That's right! We're also applying to play Beth now!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.410
Hey, have you heard?

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:46.680
Remember when that girl, Maya Kitajima, came here?

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:49.510
They say she's playing Beth in Tsukikage's newest production.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.290
But isn't she a complete novice?

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:53.440
Why do you guys have to be such jerks?

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.980
Well, well, aren't you quick to rush to her defense?

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:59.590
And why wouldn't he? After all, the two of them are...

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:01.300
Stop it, you two.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.050
I want to see what she makes of Beth.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:09.430
Why would someone like you be interested in someone like her?

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:16.040
Oh no, I'm really late! I'm off!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.330
Good luck!

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.670
Maya, what are you doing?

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:21.160
Why are you wearing Beth's costume?

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:25.220
Maya will live as Beth for a week,

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:28.250
so that she can make the role her own.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.430
After the week is up, I will test you on your role.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:37.180
If you fail, I will reassign the role of Beth.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.240
Beth's only friends are her cats...

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:45.740
She does the housework for her mother and her sisters.

00:16:45.740 --> 00:16:49.670
She spends all her time knitting and daydreaming.

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:53.490
I'm going to live the way she does!

00:17:11.620 --> 00:17:14.850
"Beth's cats were our go-betweens!"

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:19.010
"They have a most beautiful greenhouse and a simply wonderful grand piano, don't they?"

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.530
"How marvelous!"

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.680
That girl...

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.890
Man, I'm so tired...

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:28.220
I'm beat!

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:31.050
Oh... you must be exhausted.

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:33.750
We're having patties tonight!

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.060
They smell great!

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.690
Mr. Genzo's patties are better...

00:17:40.690 --> 00:17:43.560
than the ones they serve in three-star restaurants!

00:17:43.560 --> 00:17:44.780
You said it.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.800
Maya! That's not how Beth would eat!

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:51.790
What's she trying to do?

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:54.510
It's like she's pretending to be on stage!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:58.550
Why is Ms. Tsukikage pushing her so hard?

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:03.520
"Jo, I will thank old Mr. Laurence for the use of his piano!"

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:06.050
"Are you serious, Beth?"

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:10.960
"Yes. I'm not scared at all. He's a very kind gentleman!"

00:18:16.330 --> 00:18:18.690
I wonder what Maya's up to.

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:21.130
Probably trying her hardest to get into character.

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:28.140
Stop that!

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:31.300
Let's see... skip one, purl one...

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.330
Is it really okay for her to carry on like this?

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:42.290
I see Kitajima's still not going to school and just wasting her time instead.

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:44.880
All she does is clean, wash up and cook.

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:48.970
Why doesn't she give up on the role of Beth and apply to be a cleaning lady instead?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:04.990
It's strange how doing these chores can make you feel at peace.

00:19:05.970 --> 00:19:09.690
Beth survives each day the only way she knows how.

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:13.910
She's always alone, so she retreats into her daydream world to spread her wings.

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:19.670
You can't just focus on her dialog or her movements!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:23.430
You must have something behind them to hold them up!

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:31.440
You start with her feelings, and using those, you can bring forth her words and movements!

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:45.180
Welcome home!

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.320
Will you come with me for a little while?

00:19:48.760 --> 00:19:50.500
We have a guest...

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:53.310
Maya?

00:19:53.310 --> 00:19:55.390
What's wrong? It's just Mr. Hayami.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.260
Will you please take care of our guest, Jo?

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:00.720
Beth?

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.880
We've only got one day left!

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:11.430
What is Kitajima thinking?

00:20:11.430 --> 00:20:14.530
She spends all day knitting and playing with her cat,

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:15.850
instead of studying her lines!

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:19.160
Is she actually serious about this play?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:21.320
But that's what Beth's like.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:27.130
She spends every day alone in her house, with nothing but her knitting,

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.420
her cat and her piano for company.

00:20:29.420 --> 00:20:31.730
This is the Beth in <i>Little Women</i>.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:35.810
What?

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:42.090
What's wrong?

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.190
You look like you've just seen a ghost.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:47.300
Maya was sitting on her own in a dark room, knitting away, and I sorta...

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:49.420
called out to her.

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:50.470
And then what?

00:20:51.040 --> 00:20:53.980
She just turned around, still knitting, and said: "Yes?"

00:20:54.360 --> 00:20:56.140
What's wrong with that?

00:20:56.140 --> 00:21:01.850
But here's the thing, Rei... I called her Beth!

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:05.840
And she just acted like as though it was the most natural thing in the world.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:13.850
Why do you think I asked her to live as Beth for a week?

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:21.210
Aren't you excited to see her performance tomorrow, Mr. Tashiro?

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:31.210
Tomorrow, the acting test for the role of Beth will take place.

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:35.470
If Maya fails the test, Chigusa Tsukikage has already made up her mind...

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:39.230
to throw her out of the troupe.

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:46.540
Will she be able to secure the role of Beth at last?

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
Gomennette iwaretara

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
When you say "I'm sorry,"

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
Anata wo semerarenai yo

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
I can't blame you.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
Sonna watashi wo kitto shitterundeshou

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
I'm sure you know that's how I am.

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
Nee zurui yo

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
That's not fair.

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Yasashisa ni damasaretatte

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Even if I'm being fooled by kindness,

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
Anata nara isso iito shinjita

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
I believed that with you, it might be worth it.

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Sayonara wa doushite itoshiindarou

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Why are goodbyes so precious,

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
Hanareteyuku noni

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
even though they mean we're separating?

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
Ushinatta ondo wo oboeteruyo

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
I remember how it got colder.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
Yurushitai dakara anata

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
I want to forgive you, so please don't go.

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Ikanaide douka ikanaide

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Whatever you do... just don't go.

00:23:22.780 --> 00:23:25.760
Ms. Tsukikage is a harsh taskmistress.

00:23:25.760 --> 00:23:28.590
She plans to train a successor who will be capable...

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:32.220
of playing the lead in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>.

00:23:32.350 --> 00:23:35.540
I think that's an impossible task.

00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:42.250
I'll see what the Tsukikage Acting Troupe is made of when they perform <i>Little Women.</i>

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:45.160
What's that? The little one's acting strangely.

00:23:45.560 --> 00:23:49.000
What's about to happen on stage?

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 7 - The Purple Rose
